X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/tarwheels/events/316139187/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:A-20 Ride ~60 miles\, 20-21mph
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T110000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041909Z
UID:event_316139187@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T080000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260831T112229Z
DESCRIPTION:Carolina Tarwheels Cycling Club\nA regular Saturday group ride
  leaving from Wilson Park each Saturday. (occasionally Briar Chapel or Gol
 d Park)\n\nRoute: To be posted by 8:00 PM on Thursday\n\nWhat to expect:\n
 \n* Ride length of \\~60 miles\, occasionally shorter/longer\, at 20-21 mp
 h\n* Max group size of 22. If there are more than that we will divide into
  two groups before the start. (Group 1 will be at the upper range of the t
 arget pace with significant efforts at the designated segments\, Group 2 w
 ill start a few minutes later and will not be quite as intense.)\n* Double
  paceline ride with friendly and relaxed attitude/conversation\n* 10-15 mi
 nute stop along the way for hydration\, fuel\, and socializing\n* A few fr
 iendly and competitive "go hard" segments with a regroup at designated spo
 ts. (However\, not a no-drop ride)\n* Post ride continue the social/bevera
 ge option\n\nRSVP is required for all riders who either start at WP or pla
 n to join the ride on the road.\n\nYour responsibility as part of the grou
 p is to RSVP and supply your own cue sheet or download the GPS file.\n\nIf
  you plan to join the ride in progress\, please leave a comment below abou
