DTEND:20260905T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come down to Fort Macon and learn how the different cannons of 
 the fort were loaded\, aimed\, and shot.\n\nCannon firing demonstrations w
 ill be held at 10:30 a.m.\; 11:30 a.m.\; 1:30 p.m.\; 2:30 p.m.\; and 3:30 
 p.m.\n\n \n\nPhoto by J. Hill: 10-inch mortar demonstration during Labor D
 ay Weekend Cannon Day at Ft. Macon State Park.
