X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/tarwheels/events/316189057/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Tuesday Evening Year-round Ride: IGNITER
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T194500
DTSTAMP:20260905T041909Z
UID:event_316189057@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260908T181500
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260831T112229Z
DESCRIPTION:Carolina Tarwheels Cycling Club\n**Head and taillights are not
 ** **required.** **However they are certainly recommended in case someone 
 has a mechanical that delays our return** **before sunset.** **Headlights 
 must be bright enough to for you to see by\, an in-town lamp powered by di
 sposable batteries doesn't fit the bill. A loaner can often be arranged\, 
 post a comment and we'll try to arrange one.**\n\n**The tail light must be
 ** **red** **and should be run in** **steady****\, not flash\, mode.**\n\n
 **We'll keep the group together for safety. There is** ***no sprinting*** 
 **on Union Grove (or elsewhere) until spring\, and sufficient light\, retu
 rns.**\n\n**```**\n**NOTE:**\n* **The ride is limited of 16 participants.*
 *\n* **RSVP IS REQUIRED for all riders.**\n* **If you plan to join the rid
 e in progress\, please leave a comment indicating where you intend to meet
  us.**\n**```**\n\n**A year-round ride on a 22.5 mile lolipop route: up Un
 ion Grove to Borland and returning via Orange Grove/Dairyland/Albert. 18-1
 9 mph average with regroup at designated points.**\n\n**Route: https://rid
 ewithgps.com/routes/18719788**\n\n**The ride will be canceled in the event
  of rain or other water-based precipitation or if the temperature is expec
 ted to drop below freezing at any point during the ride.**\n\n**It is Tarw
 heels policy for all riders to sign the ride waiver before coming out to t
 he ride.**\n\n**\\*****\\*****\\** ***WAIVER \\*****\\*****\\*** **http://
 tarwheels.net/ewaiver**\n\n**MEMBERS need only do this ONCE a YEAR. NON-ME
 MBERS are required to do this before EACH RIDE\, please consider becoming 
 a member.**\n\n**Please consult the Tarwheels website for Ride policies (h
 ttp://tarwheels.net/wp/policies/) and the BikeWalkNC website for guidance 
 on riding in pacelines. Group Bicycling Best Practices: Skills and Techniq
 ues (http://www.bikewalknc.org/group-bicycling-best-practices-skills-and-t
 echniques/).**\n\n**Historical Note: The ride was initially established in
  2007 as a MS-150 training ride by Teams GSK and NORTEL. The name IGNITER 
 Indefatigable [team] GSK Nortel Invigorating Tuesday Evening Ride originat
 ed because participants continued to ride even when temperatures and dayli
 ght were low.**
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T112230Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/tarwheels/events/316189057/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
