BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce": "https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-open-forum"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wakeforest_chamber
SUMMARY:AI Series: Open Forum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T063000
UID:e68ab88a482ac86f4a8d6bb39d58ee37@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Will Mendoza from i90 is back.... and this time YOU SET THE AG
 ENDA! Think of this session as open office hours for all things AI. Bring 
 the questions you've been meaning to ask\, the business problem you can't 
 quite solve\, the idea you're curious about\, or event the "I keep hearing
  about this AI thing... what am I actually suppose to do with it?" No form
 al curriculum to sit through. No expertise required. Just an open\, practi
 cal conversation and the opportunty to tap into Will's experience to explo
