DESCRIPTION:<p>The B group rides at 18-19 mph average. This is a no Drop r
 ide. Distance listed below. routes vary between 27-35 miles<br>Please brin
 g <strong>2</strong> water bottles on your ride!</p><p>Ride leader will se
