DESCRIPTION:The NC TraCS Biostatistics Seminar Series is appropriate for th
 ose with a basic familiarity with statistics. These seminars introduce top
 ics not often included in STATS 101.\n\n \n\nIn this seminar Katherine How
 ell\, MSLIS\, will discuss the systematic literature reviews that go with 
 meta-analyses. Those interested may want to register for both this seminar
  and our prior presentation on meta-analyses\, but this seminar can also s
 tand alone.\n\n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nPlease note: This seminar will not be
  recorded and materials will be shared during the seminar or with document
 ed attendees only. Attendance may be gathered from Zoom attendance reports
 .
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:NC TraCS Biostatistics Seminar Series: Systematic reviews
