DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join MountainTrue’s Broad Riverkeeper for a 
 Rocky Broad River debris cleanup in the heart of Chimney Rock Village. We 
 will be cleaning up along the banks between the Southside Drive Bridge and
  the Chimney Rock State Park Bridge.\n\nTo sign up\, please use the River 
 Cleanup link below:\n\nRiver Cleanup in Chimney Rock\, NC | MountainTrue\n
 \nPlease bring water\, snacks\, sunscreen\, bug spray\, sturdy water shoes
  or sneakers (no flip-flops)\, anything else you might need to be comforta
 ble during the cleanup.\n\nWe will provide buckets\, trash bags\, “grabb
 ers\,” shovels\, gloves\, dump trailer for debris\, etc.\n\nKids under t
 he age of 18 are allowed as long as they are accompanied by a parent or gu
 ardian for the duration of the event.
GEO:35.437327;-82.240588
LOCATION:Chimney Rock Village
SUMMARY:Volunteer River Cleanup
