DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate 50 years of inspiring conservation\, ed
 ucation\, and community at the North Carolina Aquarium on Roanoke Island. 
 Golden Tides is an elegant adult-only (21+) evening where guests can enjoy
  the Aquarium after hours while honoring five decades of connecting people
  with North Carolina's coastal waters.\n\nExperience an unforgettable nigh
 t filled with live jazz\, fresh local seafood\, and breathtaking waterfron
 t views. Savor freshly shucked oysters from Cousin's Oysters\, enjoy delic
 ious heavy hors d'oeuvres by Johanna's Catering\, and sip beer\, wine\, an
 d other libations as you explore the Aquarium in a unique nighttime settin
 g.\n\nWatch the sunset from the Soundside Pier\, encounter fascinating aqu
 atic animals—including opportunities to interact with our Touch Pools—
 and celebrate this golden milestone with fellow supporters\, friends\, and
  community members. Guests are encouraged to wear gold in honor of the Aqu
 arium's 50th Anniversary.
GEO:35.91716;-75.703347
LOCATION:North Carolina Aquarium on Roanoke Island
SUMMARY:Golden Tides: Celebrating 50 Years of the North Carolina Aquarium o
 n Roanoke Island
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/golden-tides-celebrating-50-
 years-of-the-north-carolina-aquarium-on-roanoke-island
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
CATEGORIES:Ceremonies & Anniversaries
END:VEVENT
