SUMMARY:Invasive Plant Removal (Matthews)
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join NCWF Habitat and Wildlife Keepers Chapter to remove harmful invasive plant species from Squirrel Lake Park. Non-native invasive plant species like Kudzu\, Autumn Olive and Ligustrum plants greatly reduce biodiversity and habitat for native animals. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/invasive-plant-removal-matthews/
