DESCRIPTION:This masterclass introduces the core responsibilities of family
  firm ownership. Participants will examine the importance of articulating 
 a shared purpose\; defining a clear\, compelling ownership vision\; and cr
 eating explicit goals for growth\, liquidity\, and control. The course exa
 mines how ownership priorities influence strategy\, capital allocation\, g
 overnance structures\, and leadership selection over time.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Ownership in the Family Firm: Roles and Responsibilities
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/ownership-in-the-family-firm-r
 oles-and-responsibilities
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:No Tyranny Tuesdays: Raleigh Brier Creek
