 arrboro. Mostly on paved surfaces. We'll end at food/beer.<br><br>Meet at 
 Carrboro Town Commons @ 7pm\, roll out 7:30 (dm if ur late).<br><br>Don't
  forget lights and anything else you may need (helmet\, water\, spare tube
 \, multitool\, bananas\, a friend\, a waffle iron\, spare derailleur hange
 r\, space blanket\, whatever).<br><br>Let's party! ✨ see you there<br><b
