DESCRIPTION:✨ Business After Hours at Southeastern Theological Seminary 
 ✨ Join us on September 17th for a special evening of networking\, fellow
 ship\, and a first look at something new! We’ll be gathering at Southeas
 tern Theological Seminary as they unveil the exciting new addition to the 
 Akin Student Center. Come explore the newly expanded space\, connect with 
 fellow local business and community leaders\, and celebrate this exciting 
 milestone with the seminary. Enjoy light bites and refreshing beverages wh
 ile you mingle and make new connections in a welcoming atmosphere. 📅 Se
 ptember 17th 📍 Southeastern Theological Seminary 🏛️ Akin Student C
