DESCRIPTION:LOCAL ORGANIZATIONS AND INDIVIDUALS ACROSS BUNCOMBE COUNTY ARE 
 INVITED TO RING BELLS FOR ONE MINUTE\, COMMEMORATING THE SIGNING OF THE U.
 S. CONSTITUTION IN 1787.\n\nBells Across America is an annual celebration 
 of the signing of the U.S. Constitution. Participants gather to ring bells
 \, much as the church bells of Philadelphia rang out when the U.S. Constit
 ution was first signed at 4 pm on September 17\, 1787. Consider organizing
  a group to ring bells on September 17th for 1 minute at 4:00 ET to herald
  the beginning of this commemorative week.
LOCATION:Across Buncombe County 
