DESCRIPTION:11:00am-12:00pm: Unitarian Universalist Justice NC’s Friday 
 Action Hour. <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/w/87452791684?_x_zm_rtaid=7M
 gmJB_hSsCKh3xUYHZrBA.1750590489156.1865f9b53934845e34cb2d06c2d1adc5&_x_zm_
 rhtaid=5#success" target="_blank"><u>Zoom here </u></a><br><u> </u><br><
 p>Since May of 2020\, North Carolina UUs and friends have gathered on Frid
 ays to take action and experience the joy and power of community. Every Fr
 iday at 11:00am we recap the past week and take action on the issues impac
 ting our state and country. And there is always great music to help us fee
 l the justice movement in our bones! ALL are welcome! We are also blessed 
 to be joined by Unitarian Universalists\, our beloved North Carolina justi
 ce partners\, and dear friends from outside our state (shout out to our We
 st Virginia fam!).</p><p>You can join us <strong>every Friday </strong>at 
 11:00 am via this <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZMpcu
 uvpzosEtAhdqFHrSySSb6REM8wkPru">Zoom link</a>. And if you can't make it on
  Fridays\, you can still take action at any time - just check out our <a h
 ref="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Fwj6m0Qw4fAH_keuIoUNgdSWslBZzVgQ5
 NCgVPm_L-U/edit?tab=t.0" class="pastedDriveLink-0">Weekly action list</a>.
  And sign up for our <a href="https://secure.everyaction.com/QSBiJQ1YQEGwP
 O2KMIRIkQ2" target="_blank">Weekly Friday Action Hour Email</a> that inclu
 des a promo of the week's actions\, Zoom link\, and link to our Actions Go
 ogle Doc.</p><p><a href="https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-a
 ction-hour/">https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-action-hour/<
 /a> </p><u> </u>
