BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/ondraft/events/315047295/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Bike MS 2026 - Historic New Bern Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T150000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041909Z
UID:event_315047295@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260918T180000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260811T175133Z
DESCRIPTION:Team On Draft - Road Cycling\nBike MS is back in 2026! Put it 
 on your calendar! While we don't know whether the weather will be perfect\
 , soggy\, or hot and muggy\, we're gonna act like it'll be 80 degrees and 
 sunny with a 90% chance of 202.2 miles of riding. And it's nearly two week
 s later this year\, so that improves our odds a bit.\n\nThe ride begins at
  Union Point Park\, 210 E Front St\, at 8 a.m. on Saturday\, September 19.
  There will be routes of 30\, 50\, 75 and 100 miles on Saturday and again 
 on Sunday.\n\nWe'll gather Friday evening at 6 p.m.\, either at our team t
 ent in Union Point Park or at someone's Air BnB\, for a team dinner and ri
 de-strategy session.\n\nOnce you are prepared to throw yourselves into the
  awesomeness\, you can join our team on our MS Society team page: [https:/
 /events.nationalmssociety.org/teams/99623](https://events.nationalmssociet
 y.org/teams/99623) . Registration is now $50. The amount will go up a coup
 le of times in the course of the summer\; committing now will save you som
 e money and also help the MS folks plan the ride.\n\nRequirements:\nFundra
 ising Minimum: $300\nAge Minimum: 12\nAwesomeness Minimum: 8.5/10.\n\nIf y
 ou have questions about logistics or fundraising\, please contact Chris Ba
 gley or post a comment below.\n\nPlease also use the comments section to o
 rganize groups for AirBnBs. The last couple of years\, most of us have got
 ten together in groups to rent houses for the weekend. Camping in Union Po
 int Park is free ... but also potentially wet.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T175133Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/ondraft/events/315047295/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
