DESCRIPTION:Gary Owen has been entertaining audiences for more than two dec
 ades with his sharp observational humor and fearless storytelling. Known f
 or his unapologetic\, rule-defying style\, his material draws from his per
 sonal life\, time in the military and the everyday absurdities that connec
 t people across backgrounds.\n\nFollowing a wave of record-breaking\, sold
 -out performances at comedy clubs across the country\, he's attracting aud
 iences all over with his first major North American theater tour\, NO HARD
  FEELINGS. Get your tickets here.
