DESCRIPTION:Join us to learn how to make your home a safe and healthy place
  for birds! We'll review educational materials and discuss ways to create 
 bird-friendly habitats in your own backyard. While adults participate\, ki
 ds can make homemade bird feeders to take home and enjoy.\n\nImportant: We
  will be using peanut butter for the bird feeders. If anyone in your party
  has a nut allergy\, please let us know in advance so we can provide a sui
 table alternative.\nWhere: Meet at the Visitor Center parking lot. From th
 ere\, we will make our way to the Secret Pond location. We hope you'll joi
 n us for this fun and educational program!
