DESCRIPTION:RiverFest is Eden's signature annual festival celebrating the c
 ommunity's river heritage\, outdoor recreation\, arts\, music\, and small-
 town spirit. Held each September in Uptown Eden\, the two-day event featur
 es live entertainment\, local artisans\, food vendors\, family activities\
 , historical exhibits\, and river experiences. As part of America 250 NC\,
  the festival will showcase the Dan River's connection to North Carolina's
  Revolutionary War history through special exhibits and educational progra
 mming\, inviting visitors to experience the history\, culture\, and outdoo
 r adventure that define Eden as North Carolina's Small Town\, Big Outdoors
  destination.
GEO:36.490335;-79.764622
LOCATION:Washington Street\, Uptown Eden
SUMMARY:RiverFest
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/riverfest
