BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/lake-james-bioblitz"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260905T041836Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53701315805310
DTSTART:20260919T130000Z
DTEND:20260919T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join the North Carolina Native Plant Society Foothills Chapter 
 and Lake James State Park for the Lake James BioBlitz on September 19\, 20
 26\, from 9 a.m. to 1 p.m.\n\nA BioBlitz is a community science event focu
 sed on discovering and documenting as many species as possible in a design
 ated area. Participants will explore Lake James State Park while searching
  for and identifying plants\, animals\, fungi\, insects\, and other organi
 sms that make the park their home.\n\nThe event will begin with a talk fro
 m a Lake James State Park Ranger about local ecology before participants h
 ead into the field to explore diverse habitats and search for species. Whe
 ther you are an experienced naturalist or simply curious about the natural
  world\, all skill levels are welcome. This is a great opportunity to lear
 n more about the biodiversity of Lake James State Park while contributing 
 valuable observations to our collective understanding of the park's natura
 l resources.\n\nParticipants will use the iNaturalist app to document thei
 r discoveries. Before the event\, attendees should download iNaturalist\, 
 create an account\, and join the Lake James State Park BioBlitz Project. O
 bservations submitted through the project will contribute to the event's c
 ommunity science data.\n\nAll skill levels are welcome. Minors must be acc
 ompanied by an adult. Refreshments will be provided.\n\nCome explore\, dis
 cover\, and connect with the incredible biodiversity of Lake James State P
 ark. Bring your curiosity and help us document the plants\, animals\, fung
 i\, and other species that make this park unique.
GEO:35.760718;-81.882276
LOCATION:Lake James State Park - Paddy's Creek Access\, Catawba River Acces
 s
SUMMARY:Lake James BioBlitz
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/lake-james-bioblitz
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
CATEGORIES:Nature & Wildlife Programs
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Youth & Family Activities
END:VEVENT
