 eatres\, offering Broadway-quality productions in the heart of downtown Sa
 nford. In September\, Temple Theatre will present "1776: An American Music
 al\," a stirring musical set in Philadelphia in 1776. \n\nTickets range fr
 om $25 to $40 with discounts available for active military\, Lee County ed
 ucators and students\, and groups of 10 or more. Visit templeshows.org or 
 call 919-774-4512 for more information.
