 istry as Music Director Carlos Miguel Prieto leads the North Carolina Symp
 hony and guest pianist Boris Giltburg performing the Everest of piano conc
 ertos\, Rachmaninoff's Piano Concerto No. 3.  The program also includes De
 bussy's mesmerizing Prelude to the Afternoon of a Faun and Stravinsky's vi
 vid Petrouchka.\n\nDebussy: Prelude to the Afternoon of a Faun Rachmaninof
 f: Piano Concerto No. 3 Stravinsky: Petrouchka (1947 Version)  \n\nNorth C
 arolina SymphonyCarlos Miguel Prieto\, conductor Boris Giltburg\, piano
