X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/park-hangs-kit-mckay"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260905T041836Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53817603526421
DTSTART:20260925T210000Z
DTEND:20260926T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Unwind and socialize at Park Hangs\, an outdoor concert series 
 at Bailey Park\n\nGather and unwind to the NC-borne songs and spirit of Ki
 t McKay from 6:00–8:00 pm. Food truck service begins at 5:00 pm.\n\nPatr
 ick Stovall\, known as Kit McKay in his latest solo project\, offers a ref
 reshingly free approach to music-making\, entertaining the ridiculous as w
 ell as the profound. His recent release\, The Dirt Candies\, perfectly emb
 odies this philosophy. What started as weekend jam sessions with his colle
 ge roommate\, Matt Southern\, has become an unexpected calling card. The d
 eliberately silly songs have caught the attention of college radio station
 s and audiences hungry for something real.\n\nPark Hangs\n\nJoin us to unw
 ind and socialize at a new outdoor concert series with music by NC-based a
 rtists\, food and drinks by local vendors\, and easygoing vibes in Bailey 
 Park (445 Patterson Ave. in Winston-Salem). Park Hangs is presented by NCM
 A Winston-Salem and Innovation Quarter\, with additional support from Atwe
 ll Ford Real Estate.\n\nBring your own food or purchase from vendors in th
 e park or from favorite restaurants in Innovation Quarter. Drinks from Inc
 endiary Brewing will be available for purchase\; outside alcohol is prohib
 ited. Limited street parking is available\, with additional paid parking i
 n the Link Parking Deck (530 North Patterson Ave.).
GEO:36.099305;-80.24067
LOCATION:Bailey Park
SUMMARY:Park Hangs: Kit McKay
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/park-hangs-kit-mckay
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts
CATEGORIES:Concerts (Music)
END:VEVENT
