X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/the-outlander-exhibit-and-an-evening-at-the-hogg-house-scottish-cultural-event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260905T041836Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53852100046297
DTSTART:20260926T203000Z
DTEND:20260926T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Saltire Gallerie would like to invite you to attend the one
 -time only Outlander exhibit featuring skillfully crafted costumes from th
 e hit-show\, Outlander! This exhibit takes place during An Evening at the 
 Hogg House\, a Scottish cultural event focused on cultural sharing and the
  celebration of the historic James Hogg House’s 245 years of history. Th
 e event will take place at the Hogg House’s very own Saltire Gallerie\, 
 located at 209 Burnside Drive\, Hillsborough\, North Carolina\, on Saturda
 y\, September 26th. Hours for the event will be from 4:30 pm to 7:30 pm\, 
 directly following the Outlandish Hillsborough Scottish Festival. \n\n \n\
 nSaltire Gallerie is proudly in partnership with the Scottish Cultural Org
 anization of the Triangle to produce the An Evening at the Hogg House even
 t. This year’s highlights include Scottish highland dance performances\,
  traditional games\, iconic food\, serene 19th/20th century Scottish and B
 ritish fine art\, paintings of Outlander scenes\, and the Outlander costum
 e exhibit! The exhibit will feature one of the main character’s most rec
 ognized dresses\, the white dress Claire wore while on her journey through
  the stones\, beginning the romantic tale of two worlds. Also featured in 
 this exhibit are Jamie Fraser’s Continental Soldier costume\, worn durin
 g the scenes of the Battle of Monmouth during the Revolutionary War\, and 
 other costumes from the popular series. In addition\, art pieces from Outl
 ander’s production team and local artists will be on display. If you lov
 e Outlander\, you do not want to miss this
GEO:36.072733;-79.09482
LOCATION:Saltire Gallerie
SUMMARY:The Outlander Exhibit and An Evening at the Hogg House: Scottish Cu
 ltural Event
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/the-outlander-exhibit-and-an
 -evening-at-the-hogg-house-scottish-cultural-event
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
END:VEVENT
