 opriately for the weather\, wear hiking shoes\, and bring water!\n\nSpaces
  are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1
 370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests in your p
 arty and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is changed o
 r canceled.
