DESCRIPTION:Join us for this FREE event as we celebrate the Annual Overmoun
 tain Victory Men March—no actual marching required! Step back in time an
 d experience the sights\, sounds\, and stories of the Revolutionary War as
  we honor the remarkable journey of the Overmountain Victory Men and their
  role in changing the course of American history.\n\nEnjoy live music\, de
 licious food\, a photo booth\, guided hikes\, living history demonstration
 s\, local history exhibits\, and hands-on activities for all ages. Discove
 r how people lived\, traveled\, and survived along the historic Overmounta
 in Victory Trail while exploring the traditions and heritage of the Appala
 chian frontier.\n\nWhether you're a history enthusiast\, outdoor adventure
 r\, or simply looking for a fun family outing\, there's something for ever
 yone!
GEO:35.758958;-81.905411
LOCATION:Fonta Flora Brewery at Whippoorwill Farm
SUMMARY:Overmountain Victory Trail Celebration 
