DESCRIPTION:Who has the most ah-MAZE-ing America 250 design?\n\n\n\nCompeti
 tion Details\n\nDo you have a corn maze? Are you planning an America 250-t
 hemed design? We want to hear from you!\n\nDetails: Please send us a photo
  of your corn maze\, with your name and location\, to America250NC@dncr.nc
 .gov. After the deadline\, our team will vote in office for our favorite d
 esign! All photos will be posted on our website and social media to celebr
 ate your creativity. \n\nPrize: Exclusive prize pack and a visit from the 
 America 250 NC team to your maze! Can we escape? Details of our visit will
  go on our social media pages.\n\nDeadline: October 1\, 2026\n\nCorn maze 
 must be in North Carolina to be eligible. All entries must be by adults 18
  or older. Entry is not a guarantee of a visit or prize.
