DESCRIPTION:The NC TraCS Biostatistics Seminar Series is appropriate for th
 ose with a basic familiarity with statistics. These seminars introduce top
 ics not often included in STATS 101.\n\n \n\nIn this seminar Jeff Laux\, P
 hD\, will discuss the nature of power analyses and further topics.\n\n \n\
 nRegister\n\n \n\nPlease note: This seminar will not be recorded and mater
 ials will be shared during the seminar or with documented attendees only. 
 Attendance may be gathered from Zoom attendance reports.
LOCATION:
