SUMMARY:WUNC 50th Celebration and 5k
DESCRIPTION:Lace up your shoes and join us on Saturday\, October 3 at 10 a.
 m.\, for our 50th Anniversary 5K on the American Tobacco Trail! Whether yo
 u’re an avid runner or a casual walker\, we look forward to seeing you a
 nd celebrating our first 50 years of community connection and companionshi
 p.\nRegistration includes a race bib and a commemorative T-shirt for every
 one who registers by September 15th.\n\nThis kicks off WUNC's free\, 50th 
 Anniversary Celebration at the American Tobacco Campus\, featuring convers
 ations and meet-and-greet opportunities with your favorite program and pod
 cast hosts\, a mini museum\, live DJs\, family fun\, and more until 2 p.m.
 \nThere will be free parking at the North and South Decks of the American 
 Tobacco Historic District.\n\nSee more and register for the 5k here — an
 d see you soon!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/08/wunc_50th_5k_fb_post_1200x630.jpg
