BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/appalachian-autumn-market-fall-festival"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260905T041837Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52463233812958
DTSTART:20261003T180000Z
DTEND:20261003T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:Step into the beauty of fall at our Appalachian Autumn Market &
  Fall Festival! This family-friendly event\, free to the public\, offers a
  wonderful array of activities and experiences for all ages.\n\nApple Butt
 er Making & 18th-Century Demonstrations: Take a walk through history and l
 earn about the rich traditions of the past with live demonstrations of app
 le butter making and demonstrations like weaving\, spinning\, blacksmithin
 g\, and more!\n\nMaker and Food Vendors: Explore a marketplace of creativi
 ty and flavor with local artisans showcasing their crafts and delectable t
 reats. It's the perfect opportunity to discover unique treasures and savor
  delicious bites! Get ahead on your holiday shopping!\n\nLive Music and St
 orytelling: Enjoy local and traditional Appalachian musicians and storytel
 lers live and in-person! Mary Greene\, Orville Hicks\, Diandra Patterson\,
  and more!\n\nHatchet Throwing (Paid Activity): Test your aim and have a b
 last with our hatchet-throwing activity. Suitable for ages 14+. It's a fun
  and exciting way for older kids to burn off energy and challenge their sk
 ills. And of course\, it's just plain fun for adults!\n\nPumpkin Painting 
 (Paid Activity): Unleash your inner artist and transform pumpkins into wor
 ks of art at our painting station. A wonderful activity for all ages!\n\nK
 id's Costume Contest (Paid Activity): Dress to impress and participate in 
 our costume contest! Prizes await the most creative and spooktacular outfi
 ts.\n\nPet Costume Contest (Paid Activity): Don't forget your furry friend
 s! Show off their best costumes and compete for fantastic prizes in our pe
 t costume contest.\n\nRaffles: Enter our 50/50 raffle for a chance to win 
 a cash prize. Who doesn't love that?!\n\nAnd SO MUCH MORE Fall Goodness! M
 ark your calendar for a day filled with autumnal magic\, laughter\, and co
 mmunity spirit. The Appalachian Autumn Market & Fall Festival is an experi
 ence you won't want to miss!
GEO:36.208683;-81.669982
LOCATION:Hickory Ridge History Museum
SUMMARY:Appalachian Autumn Market & Fall Festival
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/appalachian-autumn-market-fa
 ll-festival
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Fairs
END:VEVENT
