SUMMARY:Move-a-Bull City | Open Streets
DESCRIPTION:Move-A-Bull City is Durham’s largest open streets celebration
  where more than 1.2 miles of uninterrupted streets will be car-free and o
 pen for anyone and everyone to move about as they wish: walk\, bike\, stro
 ll\, dance or skip. There also will be a variety of activities along the r
 oute\, including music\, food\, wellness and local government. Note that B
 lackwell\, Corcoran\, and Foster streets all will be closed during this ev
 ent.
