 more!\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the University Library and will 
 be led by librarian Lorin Bruckner. \n\n \n\nThis workshop is being offere
 d remotely via Zoom. Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc.edu/event/172
 36399
