 2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB1D7" target="_blank">https://www.mobil
 ize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/</a>\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com
 /url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/841321/&a
 mp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw23z_bx1AhXDbf2eL54
