X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/state-of-awe-air-water-and-earth-science-educators-workshop"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20260905T041837Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53799028606841
DTSTART:20261012T130000Z
DTEND:20261012T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will highlight the education programs of the Depa
 rtment of Environment Quality Divisions: The Division of Air Quality\, The
  Division of Water Resources\, The Division of Environmental Assistance an
 d Customer Service\, and North Carolina Geological Survey – all in one w
 orkshop. Participants will learn fun activities to use at festivals\, scho
 ol visits\, or even as teachers in the classroom! All activities covered c
 an easily be modified to meet K-12 standards.\n\nThis workshop is eligible
  for Criteria II or III credit from the North Carolina Environmental Educa
