UID:3mu0p08n9ds9fv29ahfda734fc@google.com__20261014
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20220506T020935Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><p>It's the Wednesday night ride!</p><p>This is a no drop 
 10 to 15 mile ride and we ride roughly an hour depending on the route.</p>
 <p><em><strong>Please note LIGHTS ARE REQUIRED to attend this ride. This i
 s a STATE LAW and we want to keep everyone safe. Thank you for your help w
 ith this.</strong></em></p><p>Don't forget your helmet.</p><p>Lets have fu
 n and be safe!</p>
