DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Transylvania Heritage Museum in Brevard for our 
 new exhibit celebrating America's 250th anniversary. Discover how Revolunt
 ionary War veterans\, including Transylvania County Patriots\, carried the
  spirit of liberty from battlefields into the rugged Appalachian frontier.
  Through artifacts\, stories and hands-on experiences - including our Revo
 lution Era Garden - explore the journey from conflict to community in the 
 mountains we call home!\n\nOpen Thursday through Saturday 12 p.m. to 4 p.m
 . Free and open to all. Donations accepted
GEO:35.234922;-82.737524
LOCATION:Transylvania Heritage Museum 
