DESCRIPTION:Come along with Outdoor Recreation staff and a member of New H
 ope Bird Alliance as we lead a bird outing and birdwatch at a city park. T
 his is the second of a 3-part series. Each bird outing takes place on a Fr
 iday and occurs at a different city park every week. The birdwatching seri
 es is open to all levels of birdwatching experience. Participants are enco
 uraged to bring their own binoculars\, as supplies is limited. <a href="h
 ttps://anc.apm.activecommunities.com/dprplaymore/activity/search?onlineSit
 eId=0&locale=en-US&activity_select_param=2&activity_category_ids=18&activi
 ty_keyword=bird&viewMode=list" target="_blank"><u>Preregistration is requi
 red</u></a> for all participants.
