SUMMARY:Live Music @ATC | Tim Wells and Les Bon Temps
DESCRIPTION:Come hear Tim Wells and Les Bon Temps play two-steps and waltze
 s in the traditional Cajun style.\n\nThis and all shows in the Live @ATC s
 eries are free\, open to the public\, and all are welcome (kids included).
 \n\nBring a chair or blanket\, get some food and drinks from a variety of 
 ATC restaurants\, and laissez les bon temps rouler!
