UID:7vihpmeg1k6esqp5s5vsvq9hfe_R20260110T150000@google.com__20261017
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20251010T141601Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Saturday 
 from 10am-11:30am with signs to protect our democracy and protest the viol
 ations to our Constitution. We will meet at the YMCA at 218 West Morgan St
 .</p><p>We need to fight for our democracy and stop and prevent future cut
 s that are hurting many. Bring friends! Bring signs that show your concern
  or are a call to action. Please avoid triggering images like swastikas.</
 p><p>See you every Saturday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians in
  Downtown Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="h
 ttps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize
 .us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfor
 democracy/event/842514/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocra
 cy/event/842514/</a> </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T021307Z
LOCATION:218 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_enoriver_org_9u7o786v1jlk6heq5cp3k1gr1k
SUMMARY:ERA - Fall Nature Fun Day!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T160000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041812Z
UID:0adc5c6bmddu0780ic6mdm3chk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T120000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260904T135829Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Help the Eno River Association celebrate the sights\, smell
 s\, and sounds of fall on the Eno River! Join us for a <b>FREE</b>\, famil
 y-friendly day of hands-on fun at the Confluence Natural Area.</p><p>Get y
 our hands and feet wet while searching the creek for aquatic macroinverteb
 rates\, make a festive fall-inspired craft\, and learn about some of the E
 no’s most fascinating “spooky” species. </p><p><b>This event is FRE
 E and registration is NOT required.</b> Drop by anytime between noon and
  4pm. <b>Geared toward families with kids\, but nature lovers of all ages 
 are welcome. </b><br></p><p><em>Restrooms are available on-site. Two acce
 ssible parking spaces connect the paved sidewalk to the pavilion. At least
  one activity will take place in the paved pavilion. </em></p><p>Question
 s? Email <a href="mailto:educatio@enoriver.org" target="_blank"><u>educat
 ion@enoriver.org</u></a> <u></u>for more information about this event.</p
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T135829Z
LOCATION:Confluence Natural Area\, 4214 Highland Farm Rd\, Hillsborough\, 
 NC 27278\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Eno River Association
END:VEVENT
