 irector Michael Arden (Parade)\, MAYBE HAPPY ENDING has been called “o
 ne of the best musicals in years” (USA Today) and even “The best music
 al in eons!” (Observer). Don’t miss the totally original new musical a
 dventure that explores what it means to be human. Even if they’re not.\n
 \nCheck the DPAC website to learn more about this six-day run (including a
 dditional matinee performances Saturday and Sunday) and to purchase ticket
 s.
