DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Mandy for a very strenuous 4 mile out and back hike
  and learn about the natural and cultural history of the highest mountain 
 range in the Eastern US. Meet at the State Park office at 9am. We will beg
 in our hike on the commissary trail. The trailhead is located at the offic
 e. This hike is very strenuous\, experienced hikers only. Bring water and 
 wear closed toed shoes. Prepare for extreme weather changes\, the weather 
 can change very quickly at high elevations.
