DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy as will gather to 
 demonstrate at the ICE facility in Cary. We will stand along Evans Road at
  the corner of Evans and Centrewest Court\, near the Cary ICE office (140 
 Centrewest Ct\, Cary). \n\nParking is available along Centrewest Court\, o
 r along Quade Drive (off Evans Road). This action serves to let ICE know w
 e do not welcome them here and also make community residents aware that IC
 E has an office - and an ongoing presence - right here in Cary.\n\nThis wi
 ll be a nonviolent demonstration. We are here to say ICE is not welcome. W
 e are standing up for what we believe in. We want to inspire people to joi
 n us and grow our movement!\n\nPlease bring signs\; no swastikas please.\n
 \nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our country and l
 et ICE know they are not welcome!\n\nSee you every Friday morning engaging
  drivers in Cary.\n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google
 .com/url?q=https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-demo
 cracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMP
