SUMMARY:Heritage Business Alliance | In Person
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T060000
UID:fbf19be75574d5622a614e1eb26c783c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The Heritage Business Alliance will gather for its quarterly i
 n-person meeting\, bringing Heritage businesses together for conversation\
 , collaboration\, and continued work on the Alliance's priorities. Wake Fo
 rest Commissioner Nick Sliwinski will join us for a discussion focused on 
 the experiences and needs of our Heritage business community\, including c
 urrent challenges\, policy changes\, and opportunities for local elected o
 fficials to better support\, partner with\, and advocate for Heritage busi
 nesses. The meeting will also include regular HBA business\, updates\, and
  continued development of the Alliance's plan of work and upcoming priorit
 ies. This is intended to be an open working conversation so please come re
 ady to share what you are seeing\, what your business needs\, and where st
 ronger connections or partnerships could make a difference.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/heritage-bu
 siness-alliance-in-person
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
