 thcare for all\, protecting the earth\, and protecting our workers. Come a
 ny time during this time. We have a mighty crew who comes each week. Thank
  you activism warriors for your dedication!!</p><p>Parking at Erwin Square
  Plaza on Rutherford — about 3 blocks walking\, slightly up hill. You ca
 n google Duke University Federal Credit Union (2200 W Main St\, Durham\, N
 C 27705).</p><p>See you every Tuesday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pede
 strians in Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="
 https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">http
 s://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p
