DESCRIPTION:Wake Up Wakefield & New Member Welcome Sponsored by Joe John\,
  Jr. at Sterling Law Start your morning with coffee\, connections\, and a 
 warm welcome to the Wake Forest business community! Join us for WakeUp Wak
 efield\, our casual morning networking event open to Chamber members and g
 uests. Bring your business cards\, grab some coffee and breakfast\, and co
 nnect with local business owners\, community leaders\, Chamber staff\, and
  Ambassadors. New to the Chamber? This one is especially for you. We'll in
 clude a brief New Member Orientation to introduce you to the Chamber\, hel
 p you put faces to names\, and make sure you know how to plug in and get t
 he most from your membership. We promise to keep it short... then it's bac
 k to networking! What to Expect: Coffee + Connections: Casual networking w
 ith members and guests New Member Welcome: A quick introduction and orient
 ation for our newest members Meet the Chamber: Connect with Chamber staff\
 , Ambassadors\, and fellow members No Charge to Attend: Registr
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
