 earning? This workshop introduces practical ways to design agentic workflo
 ws that support repetitive tasks\, information gathering\, and more! You w
 ill learn about the core principles of agentic systems and be introduced t
 o a variety of tools that you may use. This workshop emphasizes thoughtful
  and ethical use of AI tools with a focus on transparency\, privacy\, and 
 human oversight.\n\n \n\nThis workshop is offered by the University Librar
 y and will be led by librarian Rolando Rodriguez. \n\n \n\nThis workshop i
 s being offered remotely via Zoom. Register here: https://calendar.lib.unc
 .edu/event/17236827
