DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the June meeting of the America 250 NC Virtu
 al Book Club! We will be discussing The Caretaker by Ron Rash on October 2
 8 at 6p.\n\nThis historical fiction novel\, based in 1951 North Carolina\,
  has an intertwined loved story complicated by a case of polio and an over
 seas deployment. It is a rich story of male friendship\, rivalry\, and lea
 rning your place in the world.\n\nPlease read the book prior to the discus
 sion. We recommend borrowing from your local library. \n\nFree and open to
  the public. No membership required. Come to whichever book talks spark yo
 ur interest. \n\nMeeting Link\n\nMore Information\n\nSign up for an Email 
 Reminder
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Virtual Book Club: The Caretaker by Ron Rash
