 ations and all life. As a new member we would like to invite you to a spec
 ial Welcome Session where you can hear more about who we are\, what ECA ha
 s been doing\, our plans for the future\, and how you can get more involve
 d.<br><br>MORE INFO: <a href="https://www.eldersclimateaction.org/events"
 >https://www.eldersclimateaction.org/events</a>
