 onor of A250\, the theme will be Conservation Stations! Come out to the pa
 rk for games\, activities\, crafts\, and food trucks! Park staff will be l
 eading hikes throughout the event to talk about Witness Trees located in t
 he park. We are partnering with the State Climate Office of NC\, Iredell C
 ounty Library\, Overmountain Victory Trail\, DCNR Education Team\, and mor
 e! Hope to see you there!
