DESCRIPTION:<strong>Twin Peaks – Tuesday at 5:30PM</strong> (Summer mont
 hs only) The group rides together until the base of the Lamont Norwood cli
 mb.  Then it’s a race to the finish.  <em>Avg. 20mph\, gets faster later
  in the summer</em>.  <a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27699988">Ro
 ute</a>
