 gyt4KFo2ZLCRYaYSBXijcRYa6laoh_3O8dEA/viewform)</a>. If you like paper and 
 hate trees\, you can print and sign this one and return it to a ride leade
 r: [<a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=1AW-B2yoKg0Npc6lfHO0D5Qq4RBl
 5dlBt](https://drive.google.com/open?id=1AW-B2yoKg0Npc6lfHO0D5Qq4RBl5dlBt)
 " target="_blank">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1AW-B2yoKg0Npc6lfHO0D5Q
