DESCRIPTION:Prepare to celebrate and enjoy festive Scottish traditions for 
 New Year’s Eve (Hogmanay) and the Yule season. Enjoy speaking to Revolut
 ionary soldiers of the NC Highland and 71st Regiments\, listen to Gaelic m
 usic and storytelling\, learn about tartan history and see traditional Hog
 manay dishes made over an open fire\, and more. We encourage you to dress 
 in your family tartan or plaid! Food not available to the public. FREE. Al
 l ages welcome. Drop-in.
GEO:35.979741;-79.992174
LOCATION:High Point Museum
SUMMARY:Scottish Faire in Historical Park 
