DESCRIPTION:Explore the Overmountain Men's journey during the American Revo
 lution. Through maps\, documents\, and artifact images\, this exhibit take
 s a look at what compelled the local men to fight\, the events of the batt
 le\, and long lasting impact of the Patriot victory.
